  {
   "id": "starstruck-vagabond-183227@1.0.4",
   "gameId": "starstruck-vagabond-183227",
   "displayName": "Update 1.0.4",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-05-28T00:21:51.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Y'know, I was afraid after I released the game I wouldn't have anything to do in my special hobby time anymore. But now my hobby is fixing bugs, so I guess it all worked out. Today's patch will sort out the issue with derelicts with upgrade units always being located at -1,0, and that one where the planet in the first sector kept getting unsurveyed after a quit and reload. That one took some tracking down, let me tell you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Full change list",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1.0.4",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added map icon legend to the in-game manual to explain what all the symbols mean",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed derelicts with upgrade units always being at -1,0",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed planets in certain sectors getting unsurveyed after quit and reload",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a couple of hangs in Sarge's story",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Prevented crew members from requesting ship upgrades when no upgrades are available",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed crash when trying to leave planet during Hole friendship scene 3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced health loss from having no stamina and added tutorial text for going to a clinic at low health AND added a red flash when losing health, now please stop dying all over the place",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
    "new": 1,
    "fixed": 5,
